    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）三名射击运动员甲、乙、丙依次独立射击，一轮三枪，每人一枪，直至目标被射中，比赛结束。已知甲、乙、丙射中目标的概率分别为0.3、0.5、0.8,则在一轮内，乙结束比赛概率是丙结束比赛概率的：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1倍"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1.25倍"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1.5倍"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "2倍"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          139
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          133
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01-p139.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第133页",
            "pdfPage": 139
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看乙能出手的前提：甲必须没中。乙结束比赛概率为0.7×0.5=0.35。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "丙结束比赛还要求乙也没中，概率0.7×0.5×0.8=0.28。两者相除为1.25。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{P(\\text{乙结束})}{P(\\text{丙结束})}=\\frac{0.7\\times0.5}{0.7\\times0.5\\times0.8}=1.25"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选B。不能直接拿乙和丙的单枪命中率0.5、0.8相比，前面人的失手决定了能否轮到他们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          139
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          133
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01-p139.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第133页",
            "pdfPage": 139
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "轮流直到命中就停止，要给后出手者乘上此前全失败的概率。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
