    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25天津）某超市规定，消费达标可参加抽奖，分一等奖200元、二等奖100元和未中奖三种情形。已知小王消费共抽奖3次，若每次抽中一等奖和二等奖的概率分别为10%和20%，问小王共中奖恰好300元的概率在以下哪个范围内？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5% 以下"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "5%~8%之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "8%~11%之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "11%以上"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          139
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          133
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03-p139.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第133页",
            "pdfPage": 139
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先列奖金总和恰好300元的组合。只有200+100+0，或者100+100+100，没有其他可能。未中奖的概率为0.7。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "200、100、0各一次，有3!=6种顺序，概率6×0.1×0.2×0.7=0.084；三次都是100元的概率0.2³=0.008。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=3!(0.1)(0.2)(0.7)+(0.2)^3=0.092"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "相加0.092，即9.2%，在8%—11%之间，我们选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
