        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总金额条件先化成奖项次数组合，再补不同出现顺序。"
        }
